{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>יודע</b> (knows) — Some say: He will lengthen them. But the correct interpretation in my eyes: this is along the lines of את מספר ימיך אמלא (I will fill the number of your days), and HaShem knows the full measure. And because the years of the wicked will be cut short according to their deeds, as in למה תמות בלא עתך (why should you die before your time) — therefore the matter depends on their deeds."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:56.896375685Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}